  "description": "Operator sign-in for the VisuAuth.Entra (Workforce) adapter. Wraps Microsoft.Identity.Web so the admin dashboard at /visuauth/admin can challenge through your Entra tenant's hosted sign-in page and an operator reaches it with their Microsoft account. Without this package the Entra adapter registers no authentication scheme, so a protected admin has no way to challenge. Consumers who front the dashboard with their own authentication skip this package and pay nothing.",
